===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|en|enm|roum}}, {{m|enm|rom}}, {{m|enm|rum}}, from {{inh|en|ang|rūm||roomy, spacious, ample, extensive, large, open, unencumbered, unoccupied, temporal, long, extended, great, liberal, unrestricted, unfettered, clear, loose, free from conditions, free from occupation, not restrained within due limits, lax, far-reaching, abundant, noble, august}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*rūmaz||roomy, spacious}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*rewh₁-||free space}}. Cognate with {{cog|sco|roum||spacious, roomy}}, {{cog|nl|ruim||roomy, spacious, wide}}, {{cog|da|rum||wide, spacious}}, {{cog|de|raum||wide}}, {{cog|is|rúmur||spacious}}.

